'''Slayer''' is the second two-handed [[Swords|sword]].

* The primary attack is a wide 3-hit attack combo with double damage on the last hit.
* Its slower secondary attack is a thrust that deals 3x damage.

== Upgrade Information ==
Like most Ashlands-tier weapons, the Slayer can be upgraded to one of the following three variants using gemstones:

* {{Item link|Brutal Slayer}} ([[Bloodstone]])
* {{Item link|Scourging Slayer}} ([[Iolite]])
* {{Item link|Primal Slayer}} ([[Jade]])

An upgraded Slayer will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is modified using gemstones.

